Unit Inconsistency	Two stations (Guindy, Velachery) report temperature in Fahrenheit instead of Celsius.	Guindy,2026-10-01,08:00,95.0,150.2,45.0,88.5
Duplicate Records	Retry logic during daily upload transmits identical (station, date, hour) rows twice.	Adyar,2026-10-01,08:00,... repeated twice
